| 4 | Fee market is fixed; dynamic pricing was deprecated in v0.5.0 | Open |
| 6 | Result verification is improved but not fully independent: `receipt_model` proves deterministic model execution; TEE requires a registered enclave. Independent manufacturer attestation and open-ended semantic proof are future work. | Partial |
| 7 | Hub RPC/coordinator/exchange bind `127.0.0.1`; customers reach via nginx or SSH tunnel | Operational |
| 8 | Shop already forked once; follower divergence handling is new and needs soak + alerting | Operational |
