| 11 | Island credential file ownership vs `blockchain-secrets.env` root:600 still fights `aitbc market offer` as root | Open |
| 13 | Architecture system-flow still shows `aitbc-cli.sh` and Tendermint 26657 | Open |
| 15 | Dual command groups confuse operators | Open |
| 16 | Many CLI groups simulate when the service is hub-only; scenarios must label live vs simulated | Open |
| 17 | Intermediate 21–35 were written as bug tickets, not operator plays | Open |

