The hub was repointed at the key it actually holds: `PROPOSER_ID` and the keystore now say `ait1fe2d63fe87db282083b9159e5857cac788af9e03`, and block 105,628 onward declare it. The signatures still did not verify, and the V23-52 log line said why in one line:

