- **OPS-14** *(Medium)* `release/check-v0.5.0.sh:24,35,92` — the pre-tag placeholder-secret
  gate scans only `/opt/aitbc/apps`. The identical placeholder
  `PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_here` that `deployment/deploy-developer-ecosystem.sh:71`
