  latent injection vector the moment any incorporates dynamic input. Fix: array-based invocation.
- **OPS-17** *(Low)* `service-management/{fix-services,manage-services,run-local-services,stop-services}.sh`
  — four independent implementations of the same systemd start/stop logic with slightly
