  `GENESIS_PORT="8006"` with no env/flag override, unlike `multi-node/*`.
- **OPS-19** *(Low)* `economics/harvest_yield.py:1-6` — a yield-harvesting script (moves and
  compounds funds) shipping in a production ops directory while documented as a skeleton that
