    `docs/openapi` vs `docs/api` (DOC-02), the three request-ID middlewares (CORE-11), and the
    four rate limiters (CORE-10).
12. Populate `shared-core`/`shared-domain` (APP-X4) — their emptiness is the root cause of the
    duplicated boilerplate found in every service.
