- ✅ **Observability middleware** — structured request/response logging + error metrics
- ✅ **Stale port fix** — agent_stream.py default 8006→8202 (correct blockchain port)
- ✅ **Configurable agent TTL** — was hardcoded 60s/120s, now via settings (B5)


