## v0.5.12

### v0.5.12 Release Notes

**Theme:** v0.5.11 shipped with essential hardening, but this audit surfaced runtime and security gaps that remain open. This release addresses them with minimal-risk, verifiable fixes.

**Status:** ✅ ALL TASKS COMPLETE (verified 2026-06-24). Agent A tasks #1–#10 all resolved. Agent B tasks B1–B7 all done. Phase 4 tasks P1–P5 all done (P5 cancelled per P4 decision).

